{"seq":1,"slug":"image-prohibited-explicit-medical-detect","title":"违禁/暴露/医疗宣称图片识别","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/listing-multimodal-content-moderation/listing-image-review/image-prohibited-explicit-medical-detect","wordCount":2498,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"违禁-暴露-医疗宣称图片识别\">违禁/暴露/医疗宣称图片识别</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>图像审核系统返回的从来不是一个布尔值。当一张商品主图送进视觉审核服务，拿回来的是形如 <code>adult: 0.03, medical: 0.71, violence: 0.01</code> 的一组标签与分数。真正的工作从这一刻才开始：0.71 算不算违规？<code>medical</code> 这个标签在这个类目下意味着什么？它的语义和&quot;这张图里有裸露&quot;是同一回事吗？</p>\n<p>三类目标的判定性质完全不同，把它们混在一个阈值里处理是最常见的架构错误。<strong>违禁品识别</strong>本质是细粒度品类分类，要回答&quot;图中是否是枪支、管制刀具、毒品用具、濒危物种制品&quot;，判定依据是物品的类别特征，与画面整体氛围无关。<strong>暴露识别</strong>本质是人体的显式程度评估，依据是人体的位置、遮挡与暴露比例，一个穿着泳装的模特和一张色情图片之间的界线是部位而非氛围。<strong>医疗宣称识别</strong>本质是图文联合判定——图片本身可能完全正常（一盒维生素），违规在于图上叠加的文字图层宣称了疗效，这使它的判定必须跨越图像与文本两种模态。</p>\n<p>三类目标共享的工程底座是：分类器输出标签与置信度 → 分数归一化到可比较量纲 → 按类目与市场映射为处置动作 → 灰区进人工队列。本章三篇分别处理内容违规、权利侵权、质量规范，而这一篇要建立的分数归一化与阈值分层约定，是后续所有篇章共用的语言。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[商家提交图片素材] --&gt; B[视觉审核服务&lt;br/&gt;返回标签+置信度]&#10;  B --&gt; C{标签归类}&#10;  C --&gt;|违禁品| D[品类映射表&lt;br/&gt;按目标市场查禁售清单]&#10;  C --&gt;|暴露| E[人体部位与遮挡分析]&#10;  C --&gt;|医疗宣称| F[移交图文联合判定&lt;br/&gt;图层文字需 OCR]&#10;  D --&gt; G[分数归一化与阈值分层]&#10;  E --&gt; G&#10;  F --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt; H{分数区间}&#10;  H --&gt;|高置信| I[直接拦截]&#10;  H --&gt;|灰区| J[进人工复核队列]&#10;  H --&gt;|低置信| K[放行+抽样巡检]\">graph TD\n  A[商家提交图片素材] --&gt; B[视觉审核服务&lt;br/&gt;返回标签+置信度]\n  B --&gt; C{标签归类}\n  C --&gt;|违禁品| D[品类映射表&lt;br/&gt;按目标市场查禁售清单]\n  C --&gt;|暴露| E[人体部位与遮挡分析]\n  C --&gt;|医疗宣称| F[移交图文联合判定&lt;br/&gt;图层文字需 OCR]\n  D --&gt; G[分数归一化与阈值分层]\n  E --&gt; G\n  F --&gt; G\n  G --&gt; H{分数区间}\n  H --&gt;|高置信| I[直接拦截]\n  H --&gt;|灰区| J[进人工复核队列]\n  H --&gt;|低置信| K[放行+抽样巡检]</pre><p>三类违规中，医疗宣称在跨境场景最复杂，因为它同时受广告法与平台类目规则双重约束，且不同市场的判定标准差异极大。这使它的阈值不能是全局常数，而必须是 <code>f(类目, 目标市场)</code> 的函数——这一点会在 <a href=\"../moderation-accuracy-ops/market-ad-law-category-restricted\">4.1 各市场广告法与类目禁限售规则矩阵</a> 中展开为完整的规则矩阵。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三类判定目标的语义差异\">三类判定目标的语义差异</h2><h3 id=\"违禁品-细粒度品类分类\">违禁品：细粒度品类分类</h3><p>违禁品识别面对一个开放且不断变化的类别集合，每一类的视觉特征与判定依据截然不同。更棘手的是，<strong>同一件物品在不同市场是否违禁并不一致</strong>：某些国家对 CBD 制品、电子烟、特定药品的管制状态相反。因此违禁品识别模型的输出不应直接对接拦截动作，而应输出&quot;疑似品类 + 置信度&quot;，由规则层结合目标市场查禁售清单后再决定。</p>\n<h3 id=\"医疗宣称-图与文的联合判定\">医疗宣称：图与文的联合判定</h3><p>医疗宣称的违规点常常不在图像像素里，而在叠加的文字图层上。一盒普通的维生素软糖，加上&quot;临床验证治愈失眠&quot;的文字贴纸，就从合规商品变成了虚假医疗宣称。这决定了它必须跨越两种模态：视觉模型识别&quot;这里有高密度的文字覆盖&quot;以及产品品类，OCR 把文字读出来，文本规则判定宣称是否违规。这个跨模态链路的具体实现（OCR 召回口径、多语言覆盖、文字区域定位）在 <a href=\"../multimodal-text-video/ocr-in-image-multilingual-text\">2.1 图内文字 OCR 与多语言文案审核</a> 中展开。本篇只确立一个接口约定：<strong>医疗宣称的视觉侧输出是&quot;疑似宣称区域 + 品类&quot;，不是合规结论</strong>，结论由文本侧给出。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分数归一化与阈值分层\">分数归一化与阈值分层</h2><h3 id=\"为什么原始分数不能直接比较\">为什么原始分数不能直接比较</h3><p>不同审核服务返回的分数语义不同：有的是分类概率（和为 1），有的是独立置信度（每个标签独立），有的只有等级枚举。直接拿一个统一阈值去卡所有来源会在两端都出问题——概率模型在中段过于敏感，等级枚举模型又丢失了排序信息。工程上的标准做法是做一次<strong>单调映射</strong>，把各家分数压到可比较的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 区间，保留排序但不改变相对关系：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>s</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">rank</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mi>N</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s&#x27; = \\frac{\\operatorname{rank}(s)}{N}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.113em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">rank</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>排序归一化对分数的绝对标定不敏感，只依赖同一来源内部的相对次序。代价是它丢失了&quot;分数绝对值&quot;的信息，因此必须按来源分别归一化再合并，而不是把所有来源的分数扔进一个池子里排。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三层阈值结构\">三层阈值结构</h3><p>归一化之后，判定不再是一个阈值而是一组阈值，把连续分数切成三段：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>区间</th>\n<th>判定</th>\n<th>处置动作</th>\n<th>典型来源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>s</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mtext>block</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s&#x27; \\ge \\theta_{\\text{block}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8879em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">block</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>高置信违规</td>\n<td>直接拦截，不进人工</td>\n<td>明确违禁品、极高暴露</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mtext>review</mtext></msub><mo>≤</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mtext>block</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_{\\text{review}} \\le s&#x27; &lt; \\theta_{\\text{block}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">review</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.791em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">block</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>灰区</td>\n<td>进人工复核队列</td>\n<td>医疗宣称、边界暴露、疑似违禁</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>s</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mtext>review</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s&#x27; &lt; \\theta_{\\text{review}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.791em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">review</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>低置信</td>\n<td>放行 + 抽样巡检</td>\n<td>正常素材</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>两个阈值的关系不对称：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mtext>block</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_{\\text{block}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">block</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 决定漏放率（越高漏放越多），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mtext>review</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_{\\text{review}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">review</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 决定人工队列的规模（越低队列越爆）。把它们分开配置的价值在于——<strong>降低误杀不需要降低拦截力度</strong>，只需把拦截区收窄、把灰区放宽，让人工承接原本会被直接拒绝的边界样本。这正是 <a href=\"../moderation-accuracy-ops/moderation-precision-falseneg\">4.2 审核精确率/漏放/误杀度量</a> 中误杀率与漏放率能被独立优化的结构性前提。</p>\n<h3 id=\"高等级判定的扩展性\">高等级判定的扩展性</h3><p>对暴露类判定，分级枚举比布尔值更合适。Google Cloud Vision 的 SafeSearch 对 <code>adult</code>、<code>spoof</code>、<code>medical</code>、<code>violence</code>、<code>racy</code> 五类分别返回 <code>UNKNOWN</code>、<code>VERY_UNLIKELY</code>、<code>UNLIKELY</code>、<code>POSSIBLE</code>、<code>LIKELY</code>、<code>VERY_LIKELY</code> 六档之一（<a href=\"https://docs.cloud.google.com/vision/docs/detecting-safe-search\">Google Cloud Vision SafeSearch 文档</a>）。六档设计本身就说明了一个工程直觉：<strong>暴露判定需要有序分级</strong>——<code>POSSIBLE</code> 应当进人工，<code>VERY_LIKELY</code> 才应直接拦截。等级枚举在归一化时被映射为等距数值，因此它天然落在三层阈值结构的灰区里。</p>\n<h3 id=\"阈值必须按类目与市场参数化\">阈值必须按类目与市场参数化</h3><p>固定阈值在跨境场景下不可用。同一张&quot;美白&quot;宣称的图片，在允许化妆品功效宣称的市场只需提示补充备案，在严格管制的市场可能直接拦截。因此阈值与处置动作应表示为可配置的策略表，而非代码常量：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE image_moderation_policy (&#10;  policy_id        BIGINT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  market           VARCHAR(8)   NOT NULL,   -- &#39;US&#39; | &#39;EU&#39; | &#39;BR&#39; | ...&#10;  category_path    VARCHAR(128) NOT NULL,   -- &#39;beauty/skincare/cream&#39;&#10;  label_code       VARCHAR(32)  NOT NULL,   -- &#39;explicit&#39; | &#39;medical_claim&#39; | &#39;prohibited_item&#39;&#10;  block_threshold  DECIMAL(4,3) NOT NULL,&#10;  review_threshold DECIMAL(4,3) NOT NULL,&#10;  action           VARCHAR(24)  NOT NULL,   -- &#39;block&#39; | &#39;soft_block&#39; | &#39;review&#39; | &#39;limit&#39;&#10;  legal_ref        VARCHAR(64)              -- 规则来源，供审计与申诉引用&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> image_moderation_policy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  policy_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  market           </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 'US' | 'EU' | 'BR' | ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  category_path    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">128</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 'beauty/skincare/cream'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  label_code       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 'explicit' | 'medical_claim' | 'prohibited_item'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  block_threshold  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DECIMAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  review_threshold </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DECIMAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  action</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">           VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">24</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 'block' | 'soft_block' | 'review' | 'limit'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  legal_ref        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)              </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 规则来源，供审计与申诉引用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>把 <code>legal_ref</code> 落库的价值不只是合规留痕——当商家申诉时，处置通知必须能引用具体依据，否则申诉环节无法给出可被挑战的理由。这一点与 <a href=\"../review-pipeline-action/merchant-appeal-correction-flow\">3.3 商家整改与申诉</a> 直接耦合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"判定链路与外部依据\">判定链路与外部依据</h2><h3 id=\"自定义标签体系的落地方式\">自定义标签体系的落地方式</h3><p>通用图像分类器的标签体系无法覆盖细粒度违禁品，需要用带自定义标签的检测能力。AWS Rekognition 的内容审核支持通过 Custom Moderation 训练自定义适配器，把用户标注的图片喂给 <code>DetectModerationLabels</code> 来提升特定图片分布上的表现（<a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/rekognition/latest/dg/moderation.html\">AWS Rekognition 内容审核文档</a>）——这正是&quot;平台自有违禁品标签体系&quot;的标准落地方式：底座模型提供通用能力，平台用自有标注补上长尾品类。</p>\n<h3 id=\"医疗宣称的法规锚点\">医疗宣称的法规锚点</h3><p>医疗宣称的判定标准有明确的法规来源，这使它可以被结构化而非靠主观判断。美国联邦贸易委员会（FTC）依据 FTC Act 第 5 条与第 12 条要求，健康类宣称必须有 &quot;competent and reliable scientific evidence&quot;（合格且可靠的科学证据）支撑，且证据通常要求为随机对照人体临床试验；动物实验、体外研究、个案与消费者调查不足以支撑健康宣称（<a href=\"https://www.ftc.gov/business-guidance/resources/health-products-compliance-guidance\">FTC 健康产品合规指南</a>）。这条标准对审核系统的直接含义是：<strong>出现疗效、治疗、治愈类动词的宣称，其举证责任在商家</strong>，审核侧可以在无证据的情况下直接判定为高风险宣称。跨境场景下这一点尤其重要——FTC 的标准是美国的，欧盟对食品与化妆品的宣称另有专门法规，两套标准对同一句话的判定可能不同。</p>\n<h3 id=\"与相邻识别能力的边界\">与相邻识别能力的边界</h3><p>本篇的违禁品识别只看&quot;图中物品的品类&quot;，不涉及商品属性层面的贸易管制——一件商品是否需要出口许可、是否落入制裁清单，其判定的输入是 HS 编码与贸易主体，与本篇的图像特征无关，属于相邻 hub 的职责，不在本 hub 展开。同样，本篇识别出的暴露与暴力内容若出现在买家评价照片中，其处置标准比商家素材宽松，那属于 UGC 内容治理的范畴。本 hub 的边界始终是<strong>卖家在发布时刻提交的商品素材</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>图像审核服务的输出是标签加置信度，不是布尔判定；把语义不同的分数直接对接统一阈值是最常见的架构错误。</li>\n<li>违禁品、暴露、医疗宣称三类目标的判定依据完全不同：品类特征、人体显式程度、图文联合宣称。医疗宣称的结论必须由文本侧给出，视觉侧只输出&quot;疑似宣称区域 + 品类&quot;。</li>\n<li>分数归一化采用按来源排序归一，避免不同服务分数量纲不一致导致的误判；判定采用三层阈值结构，把漏放控制与队列容量控制解耦。</li>\n<li>六档等级（如 SafeSearch 的 <code>UNKNOWN</code> 至 <code>VERY_LIKELY</code>）比布尔值更适合暴露判定，因为它保留了&quot;需要人工确认&quot;的中间态。</li>\n<li>阈值与处置动作必须按 <code>(市场, 类目, 标签)</code> 参数化并落库，同时记录法规来源（<code>legal_ref</code>），供 <a href=\"../review-pipeline-action/merchant-appeal-correction-flow\">3.3 商家整改与申诉</a> 与审计引用。</li>\n<li>与相邻职责的边界：贸易管制看商品属性与贸易主体，UGC 评价内容看买家素材，本篇只看卖家商品素材本身的视觉违规。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"违禁/暴露/医疗宣称图片识别","id":"违禁-暴露-医疗宣称图片识别"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"三类判定目标的语义差异","id":"三类判定目标的语义差异"},{"level":3,"text":"违禁品：细粒度品类分类","id":"违禁品-细粒度品类分类"},{"level":3,"text":"医疗宣称：图与文的联合判定","id":"医疗宣称-图与文的联合判定"},{"level":2,"text":"分数归一化与阈值分层","id":"分数归一化与阈值分层"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么原始分数不能直接比较","id":"为什么原始分数不能直接比较"},{"level":3,"text":"三层阈值结构","id":"三层阈值结构"},{"level":3,"text":"高等级判定的扩展性","id":"高等级判定的扩展性"},{"level":3,"text":"阈值必须按类目与市场参数化","id":"阈值必须按类目与市场参数化"},{"level":2,"text":"判定链路与外部依据","id":"判定链路与外部依据"},{"level":3,"text":"自定义标签体系的落地方式","id":"自定义标签体系的落地方式"},{"level":3,"text":"医疗宣称的法规锚点","id":"医疗宣称的法规锚点"},{"level":3,"text":"与相邻识别能力的边界","id":"与相邻识别能力的边界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"图像 logo/商标侵权与品牌识别","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/listing-multimodal-content-moderation/listing-image-review/logo-trademark-image-brand-detect"}}